# Decision points in HEE-v3 at b5367bc (condensed; for the v4 module funnel)

**Source:** three read-only agents on 2026-10-01 (git show and git grep at b5367bc). Spot-checks by louranicas-2c: candidates.rs:220-236, namespace.rs:1364, native.rs:1636. Rows are condensed from the agent reports (site · kind · note). Full Jev dispositions: `~/hee4-evidence/reference/v3-evidence-b5367bc/jev-decision-map-b5367bc.md`.

**Kinds:**
- EXACT: a correctness rule; stays code.
- THRESHOLD: a tunable constant; stays code and is calibrated by measurement.
- JUDGMENT: interprets unstructured input; a Jev candidate only under a grant.

**Totals** *(rev 2026-10-01, V3 §2)*: **201 sites in the three agents' reports; 93 condensed rows here (36/31/26); only JUDGMENT=14 is recountable from this file (4/3/7); the EXACT/THRESHOLD split (145/42) is the agents' assertion.** The section headings below keep the agents' per-report site counts (91/60/50), not the row counts of their tables.

**Locator corrections** *(rev 2026-10-01, V3 §1; re-read with `git show b5367bc:<path>`)*. Six locators V3 read as comment lines were **wrong-file** cites: the line numbers are right in a submodule. Nine were shifted. Each is marked ⚠ in its row with the corrected locator; the full list is also in `~/hee4-evidence/reference/ERRATA-v3-evidence-b5367bc.md`.
